    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="9dc1279d-c713-5ec9-9994-8973a24840f8" activityNameId="78568c03-07d5-5673-897a-f689f5175113" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, production BO, at long-distance pipeline</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, production BO, at long-distance pipeline
In 2023 100% of the imported Bolivian natural gas to BO was imported by pipeline and 0% as LNG. An average distance of 0 km is estimated for the pipeline export from Bolivia, of which are 0 km offshore pipeline. The estimated shipping distance for LNG are  km. The net calorific value of natural is 36.0 MJ/Nm³. UUID=333bc54a-074b-3263-b4d0-ce2d84a92325
This dataset describes the transport needed for an average export of Bolivian natural gas. Gas losses and emissions during seasonal storage are included.
Location: The data for storage emissions are based on global data. The amount of gas stored is a rough estimate based on European data. The average weighted transport distance is based on the trade movements 2019.
Technology: The distance is an European average based on the European long-distance pipeline network and LNG shipping routes.
Time period: Transport modes investigated for 2023.
Production volume: not known
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_333bc54a-074b-3263-b4d0-ce2d84a92325.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
